  "_comment": "Image-to-video workflow — exported verbatim from ComfyUI's built-in template 'Wan 2.2 14B Image to Video' via app.graphToPrompt(). The gateway substitutes the (node_id, input_key) targets named in manifest.toml. Model paths, LoRA setup, two-stage noise split, and 4-step turbo switch all stay operator-curated. The SaveVideo filename_prefix is overwritten post-substitution by the runner.",

